OL,3,GNEWSADriver who dragged head teacher to
OL,4,Ahis death jailed
OL,5,
OL,6,FWarning: This article contains
OL,7,Fdistressing content
OL,9,FA driver who dragged a head teacher to
OL,10,Fhis death for more than a mile under
OL,11,Fthe wheels of his car has been jailed
OL,12,Ffor life for murder.
OL,14,FSimon Richardson, 35, crashed into
OL,15,F56-year-old Michael Mullins in
OL,16,FWarburton, Greater Manchester, on 20
OL,17,FApril as the married father-of-two
OL,18,Fcycled home from Stretford Grammar
OL,19,FSchool in Trafford.
