OL,5,
OL,6,FJurors at Richardson's trial heard he
OL,7,Fthen stopped to try to dislodge the
OL,8,Finjured but still-living cyclist before
OL,9,Fdriving on with him still lodged
OL,10,Funderneath the vehicle.
